  "body": "## Scope and dependency\n\nDepends on draft #352. Adds an internal SQL read projection over the existing canonical logistics activities, task policies, RACI assignments and scoped grants. No second task system, public endpoint or UI is introduced.\n\n## Requirements and invariants\n\nTR-01\u201308 refine EO-023\u2013028, EO-045 and EO-055: exact event/task/actor scope, current temporary authority after lock waits, opaque denied/missing targets, one statement snapshot for task/policy/RACI, explicit attention for expired required assignments and no read side effects. Event-read, finance, coproduction and assignment alone do not imply task access.\n\nTLA+ and Alloy checks passed before feature SQL was implemented. Finite checks are not an unbounded proof.\n\n## Schema, security and rollback\n\nTwo SECURITY INVOKER functions only; no domain tables or records added. Migration remains outside the production manifest. Existing feature defaults are unchanged. Actor and evaluation time are trusted-server inputs: a future HTTP adapter must reuse the current-session transaction fence.\n\nRollback drops only the two functions, without CASCADE or domain deletion; execute it before prerequisite rollback. Apply twice, rollback twice and reapply preserve records. No merge, deployment, credential activation or real-money action.\n\n## Executed verification\n\n- Full pinned TLC/Alloy suite: PASS; new task model 3,861 generated / 1,788 distinct states; four new negative controls detected. Full suite: 20 expected negative controls, two SAT scenarios, 11 UNSAT bounded assertions.\n- PostgreSQL 16 focused suite: PASS, including temporal/scoped permissions, malformed IDs, allowlist, attention, nine-table preservation, revocation at RC/RR/SERIALIZABLE, scope/owner/feature races, expiry while waiting and coherent concurrent task/RACI snapshots.\n- PostgreSQL 17 complete-schema rehearsal: PASS, 98 canonical manifest entries, strict schema contracts, migration retry, rollback/reapply and actual-schema task projection.\n- Repository quality: PASS. Runner isolation/wiring: 6/6. Shell syntax, YAML, whitespace and 79 documentation links: PASS.\n\n## Limitations and next work\n\nInherited full Stack no-run-tests build remains unfinished; linking its test executable is not a full build/test pass. Remote CI is not yet verified. No new HTTP, web/mobile, accessibility, performance or payment sandbox evidence. Public typed task API, field visibility, membership removal, aggregate concurrency tokens and workspace UI remain next.\n\n[Detailed evidence, exact commands, bounds and rollback](https://github.com/diegueins680/tdf-app/blob/feat/event-task-read-projection/docs/event-operations/pr-13-task-read-projection.md)",
